# Coffee Shop Launch Project

## Project Overview
A simulated coffee shop launch project created to demonstrate practical project management skills. The project covers planning, scheduling, budgeting, risk management and stakeholder management using Microsoft Excel.

## Project Objectives
- Plan the key activities required to launch a coffee shop
- Develop a realistic project timeline
- Estimate and monitor project costs
- Identify key project risks and mitigation actions
- Identify key stakeholders and their roles

## Project Deliverables
The Excel workbook contains four project management areas:

- Timeline – project activities, start/end dates and progress status
- Budget – estimated costs and total project budget
- Risk Register – key risks, potential impacts and mitigation actions
- Stakeholder Register – key stakeholders and their roles

## Skills Demonstrated
- Project Planning
- Project Scheduling
- Budget Management
- Risk Management
- Stakeholder Management
- Project Monitoring
- Microsoft Excel
